== Effect ==
* On use, takes a full heart of [[health]] and activates {{i|The Necronomicon}}'s effect, dealing 40 damage to all enemies in the [[room]].
** Blood Rights takes {{e|Red Heart}}s before other heart types.
** {{dlc|r}} This bypasses [[damage scaling]].
** {{dlc|r}} When used more than once in the same room, damage taken is lowered to half a red heart.
* {{dlc|r+}} Increases [[fire rate]] by +0.48 for the current room for the first use in the current stage.
** Subsequent uses in the same stage add a +0.15 to the bonus.

== Notes ==
* Using this item does not affect {{r|Devil Room}} or {{r|Angel Room}} chances.
* Using Blood Rights grants immunity frames; this allows access to {{r|Curse Room}}s without losing soul hearts.
* Using this item as {{C|The Lost}} or {{C|Tainted Lost}} kills The Lost, even if the protective effect from {{i|Holy Mantle}} is active.

== Synergies ==
* {{t|A Missing Page|r}} / {{I|Missing Page 2|r}}: Deals an additional +40 damage. Effects stack together and with multiple copies.
* {{Book of Belial synergy|description=Invokes the effect of {{i|Razor Blade}} along with its original effect.}}
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns red wisps in the middle ring that have higher health than average and shoot red tears.}}
* {{dlc+|a+}} {{i|Habit}} + {{i|Schoolbag}}: Damage from Blood Rights grants a point of charge to Isaac's other held active item.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|nr}} {{i|Isaac's Heart}}: Blood Rights doesn't deal damage to Isaac, allowing repeated usage without penalty.
* {{dlc|nr}} [[Shield]]/[[Invulnerability]]: Blood Rights can be used without taking damage for the duration of the shield or invulnerability. Invincibility frames from recently taking damage will not protect against this item's damage.
* {{i|The Wafer}}: Reduces the damage dealt to Isaac to half a heart.
* {{i|Bloody Lust}} / {{i|Bloody Gust}}: The Blood Rights damage counts for the raise of statistics of these objects.
* {{i|Whore of Babylon}}: As Blood Rights takes {{e|Red Heart}}s before other heart types, it can be used to get the Whore of Babylon activation's condition easier.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery}}: No effect.
* {{dlc|r}}[[Shield]]/[[Invulnerability]]: Will not protect against this item's damage.

